      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BF4202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你还要继续？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608FD889817EE77EEDFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀……我长篇大论地讲了一堆，\n真是抱歉。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但连续招式的魅力还不止这些……\n剩下的我通过对战来告诉你吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440202620266211957F7BC759278BBA57308BB24E864E005806FF0C000A771F662F62B16B49300200100001BE01000A4F468FDE7EED62DB5F0F76849B45529B8FD84E0D6B628FD94E9B20262026000A52694E0B76846211901A8FC75BF962186765544A8BC94F605427300200100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等你做好准备，\n就来跟我搭话吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
