      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我说……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BF4202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你还要继续？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608FD889817EE77EEDFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀……我长篇大论地讲了一堆，\n真是抱歉。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n请你一定要收下这个招式学习器。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440202620266211957F7BC759278BBA57308BB24E864E005806FF0C000A771F662F62B16B49300200100001BE01000A8BF74F604E005B9A898165364E0B8FD94E2A62DB5F0F5B664E605668300200100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "冰属性招式<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>三旋击<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>会连续跳跃3次，\n优美地发动攻击。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51B05C5E602762DB5F0F00100002FF0000064E0965CB51FB00100002FF0000004F1A8FDE7EED8DF38DC300336B21FF0C000A4F187F8E573053D152A8653B51FB300200100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且！第2次会比第1次跳得更高，\n第3次会比第2次更高。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n攻击范围也会越来越大！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E14FF017B2C00326B214F1A6BD47B2C00316B218DF35F9766F49AD8FF0C000A7B2C00336B214F1A6BD47B2C00326B2166F49AD8300200100001BE00000A653B51FB830356F44E5F4F1A8D8A67658D8A5927FF0100100002011401E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所有攻击都命中时的快感……\n与各种要素都能契合的战略性……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n请你也一定要体验一下\n连续招式的这些魅力。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǦ",
